# Sub-Agent Workflow Standard

Sub-agents preserve your context (cursor rules stay fresh) and cost ~10x less than doing everything in the main thread.

**When to use:** Multi-repo operations, 3+ steps, tasks requiring >100K token file reads, parallel independent tasks.

**Example:** `Execute unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/tasks/TASK_X_[NAME].md in full` — task doc launches sub-agents.

**Full docs:** `unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/tasks/` (TEMPLATE.md, TOKEN_TRACKING_GUIDE.md, RESUME_PATTERN.md)

